From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adeeb Shihadeh <adeeb@comma.ai>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 04:50:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: add DWO

DWO is a display panel maker in Shenzhen. Add its prefix for the
DO0200FAT07 panel used on the comma four.

Signed-off-by: Adeeb Shihadeh <adeeb@comma.ai>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
index ba20029693..9bef7afd34 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -475,6 +475,8 @@ patternProperties:
     description: DaSheng, Inc.
   "^dserve,.*":
     description: dServe Technology B.V.
+  "^dwo,.*":
+    description: Shenzhen DWO Technology Co., Ltd.
   "^dynaimage,.*":
     description: Dyna-Image
   "^ea,.*":
